# Thomson Reuters (1979–2019) and CRSP (2020–2023) mutual-fund Active Share panels,
# generated from WRDS. This is LICENSED data (CRSP / Thomson / WRDS terms forbid
# redistribution) and the files are huge (the TR panel is ~191 MB — over GitHub's
# 100 MB hard limit). This repo is PUBLIC, so the raw panels must never be
# committed. Only reduced, attributed aggregates would ever ship as generated TS.
*.csv
*.sas7bdat
*.pdf
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.manifest.json
